    92  ### Critical finding: Systematic mean decrease with N (timer overhead bias)
    93  
    94  For builtin_sorted, the **mean per-call time DECREASES as N increases**:
    95  
    96  | Size | Input    | N=1    | N=10   | N=100  | N=1000 |
    97  |------|----------|--------|--------|--------|--------|
    98  | 32   | random   | 0.51   | 0.42   | 0.41   | 0.41   |
    99  | 32   | sorted   | 0.37   | 0.27   | 0.27   | 0.27   |
   100  | 32   | reverse  | 0.40   | 0.30   | 0.29   | 0.29   |
   101  | 32   | duplicates| 0.46  | 0.36   | 0.35   | 0.35   |
   102  | 128  | random   | 2.10   | 2.00   | 1.99   | 1.99   |
