   104  | 128  | reverse  | 1.01   | 0.92   | 0.89   | 0.89   |
   105  | 128  | duplicates| 1.71  | 1.66   | 1.61   | 1.61   |
   106  | 512  | random   | 11.56  | 10.45  | 10.47  | 10.46  |
   107  | 512  | sorted   | 2.63   | 2.52   | 2.53   | 2.53   |
